{"unit_id":"bingomu__dsh-followup#card-zh","repo":"bingomu/dsh-followup","commit":"416f3b854d0c114512f7ae65124ee7144c30aa5b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-followup 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的对话跟进插件。它在侧栏提供跟进入口，在会话头部加入状态与项目控制，并打开汇总任务、会话、定时事项和项目的面板。插件还注册 followup_add、followup_list、followup_done 三个 agent 工具，并通过系统提示引导 agent 记录未完成事项。用户可以添加带自然语言到期时间的任务、完成或恢复任务、查看未收尾会话和定时任务、绑定项目并标记发布状态。适合需要跨会话整理提醒和项目进度的 DSH 用户；无需 API key，数据保存在本地 DSH 目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:29-68","client.js:1875-1886","lib/tools.js:48-97","lib/store.js:21-25"]}
{"unit_id":"bingomu__dsh-followup#card-en","repo":"bingomu/dsh-followup","commit":"416f3b854d0c114512f7ae65124ee7144c30aa5b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-followup adds a follow-up panel to DSH's web client. Users can add dated tasks, mark them done, review unfinished sessions and schedules, bind projects, and track releases. Three agent tools record and list tasks. Data stays in local DSH storage; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:29-68","client.js:1875-1886","lib/tools.js:48-97","lib/store.js:21-25"]}
