{"unit_id":"bingomu__dsh-followup#feature-1","repo":"bingomu/dsh-followup","commit":"416f3b854d0c114512f7ae65124ee7144c30aa5b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-followup 的功能「agent 跟进工具」：agent 可调用 followup_add 记录带标题、备注、优先级和自然语言截止时间的事项，也可用 followup_list 查询、用 followup_done 完成事项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:48-105"]}
